Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.82,0:01:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.96,0:01:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的军队攻来了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.45,0:01:39.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,派出诅咒战士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.32,0:02:57.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,消灭他们 我们才能生存
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.11,0:03:01.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这场战争还远没有结束
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.60,0:23:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太粒子唤醒了我们
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.02,0:23:06.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚又开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.99,0:29:30.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,瞧瞧我留下了什么 阿格姆
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.41,0:29:34.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我几乎记不清光明之前的日子了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.54,0:29:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们种族的延续将是你留给后世的遗产
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.67,0:29:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要让阿斯加德人尝尽我们吃的苦头
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.43,0:29:45.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回以太粒子
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.76,0:29:47.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要恢复我们的世界
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.09,0:29:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要终结这饱受荼毒的宇宙
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.14,0:33:27.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚即将形成
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.44,0:33:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将是最后一个诅咒战士
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.36,0:33:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我愿牺牲自己
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.95,0:33:40.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像我们的人民
Dialogue: 0,0:33:41.33,0:33:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和你那样
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.28,0:33:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你将成为黑暗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.47,0:33:57.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,并维持这一形态 直到它耗尽你的生命
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.43,0:34:06.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,在那之前 我们的敌人将不是你的对手
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.40,0:34:16.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我将摧毁他们的防线 让你回到一个崭新的宇宙中
Dialogue: 0,0:53:02.07,0:53:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,恢复吧 夺回以太粒子 你需要力气
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.57,0:53:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,等你醒来 我们去把他们赶尽杀绝
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.11,1:08:19.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得马上出击
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.50,1:08:21.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.12,1:08:28.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不必去阿斯加德了
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.96,1:08:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太自己送上门了
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.55,1:15:02.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是阿斯加德的敌人
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.95,0:03:49.54,Title,0,0,0,0,,《雷神2：黑暗世界》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.31,0:06:18.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（华纳海姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.43,0:09:45.23,Note,0,0,0,0,,（阿斯加德）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.93,Note,0,0,0,0,,（伦敦）
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.35,0:29:16.68,Note,0,0,0,0,,（瓦特海姆）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.23,0:00:38.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,早在光出现之前 世界是一片黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long before the birth of light, there was darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.88,0:00:42.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,那黑暗孕育了黑暗精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and from that darkness came the Dark Elves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.76,0:00:46.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,一千年前\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millennia ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.28,0:00:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,最残暴的黑暗精灵 马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most ruthless of their kind, Malekith,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.83,0:00:51.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,企图将我们的宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}sought to transform our universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.03,0:00:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,重归于无尽黑夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}back into one of eternal night.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.95,0:00:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,要实现这邪恶的计划\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such evil was possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:01:00.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须借助以太粒子的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}through the power of the Aether,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.77,0:01:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是能带来无限毁灭的古老武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}an ancient force of infinite destruction.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.24,0:01:21.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的圣军\N{\fnArial\fs30}The noble of armies of Asgard,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.22,0:01:23.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我父亲包尔王的率领下\N{\fnArial\fs30}led by my father, King Bor,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.28,0:01:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,对这些邪恶的生灵发起了伟大的战争\N{\fnArial\fs30}waged a mighty war against these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.49,0:01:59.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国的汇聚渐渐形成\N{\fnArial\fs30}As the nine worlds converged above him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.35,0:02:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯终于可以释放以太粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith could at last unleash the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.95,0:02:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,但阿斯加德从他手上夺走了那武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}But Asgard ripped the weapon from his grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.31,0:02:29.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了武器 黑暗精灵就此战败\N{\fnArial\fs30}Without it, the Dark Elves fell.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.45,0:02:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,尽管大势已去\N{\fnArial\fs30}With the battle all but lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.61,0:02:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯仍不惜牺牲他的部下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith sacrificed his own people.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.70,0:02:52.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,妄图与阿斯加德军队同归于尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}in a desperate attempt to lay waste to Asgard's army.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.73,0:03:13.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯被击败 以太粒子也被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith was vanquished, and the Aether was no more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.47,0:03:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少我们以为是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or so we were led to believe…
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.64,0:03:22.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下 是否要摧毁以太粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sire, the Aether, shall we destroy it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.83,0:03:27.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,只可惜它的力量太过强大 我们无法摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}If only we could, but its power is too great.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.90,0:03:29.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,将它深埋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bury it deep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.59,0:03:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,藏在没人能找到的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somewhere no one will ever find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.84,0:04:15.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.17,0:04:17.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.23,0:04:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为我骄傲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have I made you proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.02,0:04:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你 别让事情变得更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, don't make this worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.66,0:04:23.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎样才算更糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Define "worse".
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.32,0:04:25.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.14,0:04:28.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要单独跟犯人谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will speak to the prisoner alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.42,0:04:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,有何必要如此大惊小怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I really don't see what all the fuss is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.80,0:04:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还没认识到你罪行的严重性吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you not truly feel the gravity of your crimes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.67,0:04:53.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所到之处 必是战争 毁灭与死亡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wherever you go there is war, ruin and death.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是作为仁慈的神去米德加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}I went down to Midgard to rule the people of Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,统治地球人民\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a benevolent god,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.71,0:04:59.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.46,0:05:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不是神\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are not gods.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们跟人类一样 出生 生活然后死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are born, we live, we die, just as humans do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.61,0:05:09.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是我们能活五千年\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give or take five thousand years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.12,0:05:14.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一切都是因为你想要王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}All this because Loki desires a throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.13,0:05:15.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我与生俱来的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my birthright!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.52,0:05:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你与生俱来的权利\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your birthright.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.48,0:05:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,是一出生\N{\fnArial\fs30}was to die…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.51,0:05:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,就死去\N{\fnArial\fs30}as a child!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.00,0:05:24.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你本被丢弃在冰冷的岩石上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cast out onto a frozen rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.51,0:05:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不是我当时收留了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I had not taken you in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.90,0:05:31.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,此刻你就不会站在这里憎恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would not be here now to hate me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.59,0:05:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我该被处死 那发发慈悲\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I am for the axe, then for mercy's sake,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.80,0:05:35.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧动手吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}just swing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我并非不喜欢和你谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not that I don't love our little talks,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.71,0:05:39.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.80,0:05:42.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的确不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't love them.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.62,0:05:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还活着 完全是因为弗丽嘉不忍杀你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigga is the only reason you are still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.95,0:05:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以后休想再见她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you will never see her again.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.10,0:05:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会在地牢里度过余生\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will spend the rest of your days in the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.57,0:05:56.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,那托尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of Thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在牢里关到死 你却要封那个蠢货为王吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll make that witless oaf king while I rot in chains?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.98,0:06:04.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔必须尽力弥补你造成的损害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor must strive to undo the damage you have done,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.73,0:06:08.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他将恢复九大王国的秩序 之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will bring order to the nine Realms and then,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.27,0:06:11.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 他会成为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}yes, he will be king.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.32,0:07:01.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,局面完全在我掌控之中\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got this completely under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.51,0:07:03.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,难怪四处火光连天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that why everything's on fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.52,0:07:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.98,0:07:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.83,0:08:15.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.82,0:08:20.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我接受你的投降\N{\fnArial\fs30}I accept your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.17,0:08:34.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.36,0:08:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许下次我们该直接拿块头大的下手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps next time we should start with the big one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,接下来去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.18,0:09:09.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,霍根 九大王国都已基本恢复安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hogun, the peace is nearly won across the Nine Realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.07,0:09:11.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You should stay here.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.74,0:09:13.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你的人民在一起 这也是你心之所向\N{\fnArial\fs30}be with your people where your heart is,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.88,0:09:15.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,迟点回阿斯加德也无妨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgard can wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.91,0:09:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.67,0:09:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也该谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}As you have mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.92,0:09:27.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔 可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall, when you're ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.58,0:10:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,华纳海姆安定了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is Vanaheim secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.67,0:10:16.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 诺恩海姆和里亚也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are Nornheim and Ria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.41,0:10:18.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果您率军亲征 战事必能更早结束\N{\fnArial\fs30}Though our work would have gone more quickly with you at the fore.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.55,0:10:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定把我当成一块面包了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must think I'm a piece of bread.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.78,0:10:23.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要时常涂上甜言蜜语\N{\fnArial\fs30}that needs to be buttered so heavily.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.27,0:10:25.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was not my intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.56,0:10:28.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥被毁之后 这是九大王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the first time since Bifrost was destroyed,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.79,0:10:30.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次重归安宁\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Nine Realms are at peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.80,0:10:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会因此铭记我们的强大\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're well reminded of our strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.45,0:10:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你也赢得了他们的敬意和我的谢意\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you have earned their respect and my gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.59,0:10:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.11,0:10:44.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都安定了 除了你茫然若失的心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing out of order except your confused and distracted heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.14,0:10:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这与简·福斯特无关 父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't about Jane Foster, father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.51,0:10:49.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类的生命转瞬即逝 不值得挂心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human lives are fleeting, they're nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.72,0:10:52.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你该好好珍惜眼前人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'd be better served by what lies in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:56.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说这话 不是以众神之父的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you this not as the All-father,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.41,0:10:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而是以父亲的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}but as your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.72,0:11:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你准备好了 该接掌王位了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are ready, the time has come for you to take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.67,0:11:02.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,去享受庆祝你的胜利吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Embrace and celebrate what you've won.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.84,0:11:04.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,与你的将士一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Join your warriors,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.39,0:11:07.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,美酒佳肴 举杯同庆\N{\fnArial\fs30}eat and drink, revel in their celebration.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.01,0:11:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,至少也装出点开心的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least pretend to enjoy yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:56.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Another.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.85,0:12:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以前会欢庆上好几个星期呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was a time when you would celebrate for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.22,0:12:19.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我记得海拉根一战后 你兴致高昂\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember you celebrated the Battle of Harokin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.40,0:12:22.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,差点挑起了第二次战役\N{\fnArial\fs30}so much that you nearly started the second.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.39,0:12:25.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁让第一仗那么过瘾呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the first was so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.82,0:12:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我喝一杯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take a drink with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.96,0:12:36.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,众神之父今晚不会再派任务给你了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surely the All-father could have no further task for you tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.53,0:12:38.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 可我给自己派了任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this is one I set myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.81,0:12:43.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我注意到你每晚都会消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}It does not go unnoticed that you disappear each night.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.47,0:12:45.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,世间有九大王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are Nine Realms,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.63,0:12:49.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德未来的国王不能只盯着其中一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}the future king of Asgard must focus on more than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.68,0:12:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你的英勇与谏言 尊贵的希芙小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thank you for your sword and for your counsel, good Lady Sif.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.83,0:13:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有什么放不下的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the story with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.66,0:13:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么非得有事 我没什么放不下的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why does there have to be a story, there's no story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.68,0:13:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们约会的前十分钟里\N{\fnArial\fs30}You spent the first ten minutes of our date.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.20,0:13:32.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都躲在一份只有三道菜的菜单后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}hiding behind a menu that has three choices on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.65,0:13:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能选的就只有鸡肉 蔬菜或鱼 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's either chicken, vegetarian or fish, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.74,0:13:36.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你有放不下的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think there's a story.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.85,0:13:40.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,而那件事是有关一个男人的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm thinking the story involves a guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.84,0:13:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一言难尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's complicated.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.33,0:13:43.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还在你身边吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is he still around?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.69,0:13:45.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.31,0:13:47.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}went away.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也经历过\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,心爱的人离开是很痛苦的事 不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The going away. It's hard, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.26,0:13:54.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前交往过一个女人 她去纽约工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was seeing a woman and uh…she took a job in New York,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.23,0:13:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,最终感情敌不过距离\N{\fnArial\fs30}eventually the distance killed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.04,0:13:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}And…and the fact that she uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.00,0:14:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,她一直跟别的男人上床\N{\fnArial\fs30}she kept sleeping with other dudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.74,0:14:02.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是吧 - 好多呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Oh, so many.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.67,0:14:06.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 能给我们上点红酒吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi. Um…could we get some wine please?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.73,0:14:07.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊 我也想来点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, I'd love some.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.69,0:14:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德 这是达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard, this is Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.38,0:14:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.61,0:14:15.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.27,0:14:19.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去了实验室也就是你妈家\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I show up to work at the lab/your mom's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.21,0:14:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,满心以为会看到你穿着睡衣在屋里晃悠\N{\fnArial\fs30}fully expecting you to be moping around in your pajamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.82,0:14:26.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃着冰激凌 念念不忘…那个谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}eating ice cream obsessing about… you know who…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.51,0:14:29.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,可你居然没有 你穿上了淑女装\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you're not! You're wearing lady clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.43,0:14:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至还洗了澡 对吧 香喷喷的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you even showered, didn't you? You smell good.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.24,0:14:32.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is there a point to all this,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.37,0:14:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跑到这儿来找我一定有什么要紧事\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there really needs to be a point to all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.51,0:14:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.33,0:14:38.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,还记得你被你丢在一边的科学仪器吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know all that scientific equipment you don't look at anymore?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.43,0:14:41.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在得开始看了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might wanna start looking at it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.41,0:14:43.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们大老远跑来就是为了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the reason we came all the way out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.50,0:14:44.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,出故障了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's malfunctioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.67,0:14:45.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I said.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.30,0:14:48.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也这么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I did!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.71,0:14:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,还以为你做事会更科学点\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd do something a little more scientific.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.84,0:14:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 应该没什么问题 - 嗯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sure it's nothing. - Yeah, it's…
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.50,0:14:53.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看起来不像没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't look like nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.85,0:14:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,有点像艾瑞克之前念叨的那些读数\N{\fnArial\fs30}Kind of looks like the readings that Erik was rambling about.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.66,0:14:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的朋友艾瑞克 他有点疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our friend Erik, kind of went banana-balls.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.69,0:15:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.57,0:15:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我有兴趣 - 我也没兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm interested. - I'm not interested.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.87,0:15:02.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可以走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time for you to go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.79,0:15:05.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.15,0:15:10.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,短暂但愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Short but sweet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.25,0:15:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,她该吃药了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She needs help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.46,0:15:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是点份鲈鱼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I'm gonna have the sea bass.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.26,0:15:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲈鱼 嗯 鲈鱼不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea bass. Yeah, sea bass is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.34,0:15:22.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲈鱼 鲈鱼 鲈鱼 鲈鱼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sea bass, sea bass, sea bass, sea bass,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.83,0:15:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲈鱼 鲈鱼 鲈鱼 鲈鱼…\N{\fnArial\fs30}sea bass, sea bass, sea bass…sea bass. Sea bass…
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.05,0:15:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 鲈鱼 - 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sea bass. - Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.44,0:15:32.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是别念叨鲈鱼了\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe you should stop saying "sea bass"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.90,0:15:34.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你朋友走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}and go after your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.14,0:15:36.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,午餐很愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was so fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.47,0:15:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就自己在这儿念叨鲈鱼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'll just stay here and say "Sea bass" alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.08,0:15:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我恨你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.66,0:15:50.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了 我都夸他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?! I said he was cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.56,0:15:52.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是闭嘴开车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just shut up and drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.20,0:16:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,下个路口左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to take the next left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.33,0:16:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's he?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.20,0:16:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:07.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你都有实习生了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have an intern?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.53,0:16:08.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:10.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 福斯特博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, Dr. Foster. It's uh…
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.74,0:16:12.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能与你共事真是太荣幸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's such a great honor to be working with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.76,0:16:14.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我得打给艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. I need to call Erik.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.25,0:16:16.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,右转\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, uh…take a right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.22,0:16:20.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,再左转\N{\fnArial\fs30}And a left.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.96,0:16:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,在伦敦开车我已经驾轻就熟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have totally mastered driving in London.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.94,0:16:28.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂 艾瑞克 还是我 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Erik, it's me again. Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.52,0:16:30.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我过来是因为你说你有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}I came here because you said you were onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.36,0:16:31.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果你却消失了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then you vanish.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.58,0:16:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在在巨石阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here at Stonehenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.24,0:16:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,对今天发生的一则趣闻进行跟踪报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}for what has been an interesting unfolding of events today.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.64,0:16:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方于今天上午11点刚过时\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police were called to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,接到报警 赶到现场\N{\fnArial\fs30}shortly after 11 a.m. this morning,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.83,0:16:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,一名看似正常的男游客来到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}after a seemingly harmless rambler approached the area.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.35,0:16:45.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,随即开始裸奔\N{\fnArial\fs30}then, decided to strip naked.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.31,0:16:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,并举着科学仪器 吓坏了游客\N{\fnArial\fs30}and effectively terrorize tourists there with scientific equipment.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.05,0:16:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘴里喊着他是想救他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}while shouting that he was trying to save them.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.55,0:16:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,此人随后被证实为著名天文物理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}The man later identified as noted astrophysicist.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.58,0:16:55.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克·塞尔维格博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Erik Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.75,0:16:58.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他目前已被警方拘留待审\N{\fnArial\fs30}has been called in for questioning by police.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.78,0:17:02.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走 多令人激动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, this is exciting!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.20,0:17:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,看 实习生都激动了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, the intern is excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.24,0:17:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ian".
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.05,0:17:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,要带上相位表吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want the phase meter?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.71,0:17:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不要 - 拿上相位表\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Bring the phase meter.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.20,0:17:11.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,长得像面包机的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}The toaster-looking thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.24,0:17:13.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道相位表长什么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I know what the phase meter is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.67,0:17:24.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这手机的铃声要怎么换\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I change the ringtone on this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.14,0:17:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,有三个学位的天文物理学家\N{\fnArial\fs30}An astrophysicist with three degrees.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.09,0:17:28.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,应该会自己换铃声\N{\fnArial\fs30}should be able to change her own ringtone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.00,0:17:29.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么要打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.01,0:17:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想大喊大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't want to shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.04,0:17:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,实习生说往这边走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Intern says it's this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.75,0:17:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩 我叫伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Ian". My name is Ian.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.52,0:17:51.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不想因为搞个科学被人捅死\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am not getting stabbed in the name of science.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的 我们是美国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, we're Americans!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.83,0:17:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样说他们就会喜欢我们了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that supposed to make them like us?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.92,0:17:56.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们能把它弄走\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'll make it go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.42,0:17:59.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, they're kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.49,0:18:01.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们是警察吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you the police?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.54,0:18:06.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们是科学家 我是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we're scientists. Well, I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.02,0:18:07.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 我们无意中发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thanks. - We just found it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.62,0:18:11.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,能带我们去看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you show us?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.36,0:18:39.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可不太正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}That doesn't seem right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.89,0:18:58.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.54,0:19:13.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.01,0:19:15.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}that's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.91,0:19:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.45,0:19:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候能回来 有时候回不来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes they come back, sometimes they don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.38,0:19:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也想丢个东西 简 把你的鞋给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to throw something. Jane, give me your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.58,0:19:43.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我上次见到这样的读数还是在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't seen readings like this since…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.44,0:19:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}since…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.44,0:19:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,新墨西哥吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}New Mexico?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.01,0:19:52.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么都别碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.75,0:19:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,把你的鞋给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give me your shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.39,0:20:20.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是车钥匙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Were those the car keys?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.81,0:20:59.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darcy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.27,0:23:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're late.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.02,0:23:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时欢庆比战斗更累人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Merriment can sometimes be a heavier burden than battle.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.41,0:23:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你一定有一样没做对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then you're doing one of them incorrectly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.45,0:23:31.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.10,0:23:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,繁星都还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}How fare the stars?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.86,0:23:35.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,一如既往地闪烁着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.64,0:23:39.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在这儿能看到九个王国和亿万生灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}From here I can see nine realms and ten trillion souls.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:46.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得我跟你说过的天体汇聚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you recall what I told you of the Convergence?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:49.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得 各个王国连成一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, the alignment of the worlds.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.04,0:23:51.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,快要到来了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It approaches, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.85,0:23:53.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这宇宙奇观上一次出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe hasn't seen this marvel.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.61,0:23:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在我守卫开始之前了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since before my watch began.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.85,0:23:59.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,很少有人能感觉到 能看到的更少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Few can sense it, even fewer can see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.85,0:24:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然它可能带来危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}But while its effects can be dangerous,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.97,0:24:07.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但真是美极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}it is truly beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.11,0:24:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我什么也看不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.83,0:24:14.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,也许是因为那不是你想看的美景\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or perhaps that is not the beauty you seek.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.01,0:24:20.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,她怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.47,0:24:23.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的凡人还挺聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's quite clever, your mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.35,0:24:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,她自己还不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}She doesn't know it yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.59,0:24:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她也在研究天体汇聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}but she studies the Convergence as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.62,0:24:28.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,甚至…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even…
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.51,0:24:31.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.02,0:24:36.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.83,0:25:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.94,0:25:20.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.44,0:25:22.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会报警了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me you didn't call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.02,0:25:23.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.25,0:25:24.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,别报警啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not call the police!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.32,0:25:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我急疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was freaking out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.12,0:25:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你报警 警察就会通知联调局\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call the cops, they tell the Feds,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.68,0:25:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,紧接着神盾局就从天而降\N{\fnArial\fs30}the next thing you know we have S.H.I.E.L.D crawling all over,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.49,0:25:29.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这里变成51区\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Area 51-ing" the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.63,0:25:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 简 - 我们发现了一个稳定的重力异常场\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Jane! - We had a stable gratification anomaly,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.41,0:25:33.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且能自由进行研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had unimpeded access.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.84,0:25:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们唯一的竞争对手是十岁的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our only competition was ten years old!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.71,0:25:38.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你失踪了五个小时\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, you were gone for five hours!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.53,0:25:39.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.59,0:25:47.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,好诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's weird.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.81,0:26:10.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,总这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Typical.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:12.02,0:26:12.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:15.63,0:26:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我必须确认下你是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. I just needed to make sure you were real,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.40,0:26:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天真的好诡异\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's been a very strange day.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.98,0:26:21.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是真的 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I am. Jane what…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.16,0:26:23.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.53,0:26:24.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你又去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:25.33,0:26:26.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔看不到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Heimdall could not see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.90,0:26:28.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在原地等你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was right here where you left me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.82,0:26:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一直在等你 后来我哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was waiting and then I was crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.04,0:26:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,再后来我到处去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then I went out looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.72,0:26:33.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说你会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said you were coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.86,0:26:36.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 但是彩虹桥被毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know, but the Bifrost was destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.82,0:26:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国爆发了战乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nine Realms erupted into chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.58,0:26:41.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,战争肆虐 劫盗成群\N{\fnArial\fs30}wars were raging, marauders were pillaging.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.31,0:26:43.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须制止杀戮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to put an end to the slaughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.64,0:26:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个理由倒是不坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}As excuses go, it's not terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.45,0:26:51.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我在电视上看见你了 你去了纽约啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I saw you on TV, you were…you were in New York!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.07,0:26:54.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 我那时努力保护你不受来自我的世界的侵害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, I fought to protect you from the dangers of my world,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.71,0:26:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我错了 我太傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I was wrong, I was a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.57,0:27:02.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信是命运让我们走到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I believe that fate brought us together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.18,0:27:07.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 我不知道你去了哪 发生了什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, I don't know where you were or what happened,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.09,0:27:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我很清楚一件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I do know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.21,0:27:09.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.56,0:27:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know…
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.65,0:27:14.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You do?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.32,0:27:17.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do what?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.97,0:27:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.32,0:27:23.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你干的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.00,0:27:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们有点事要忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh…we're kind of in the middle of something here.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.88,0:27:33.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我确定我们要被捕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…I'm pretty sure we are getting arrested.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.07,0:27:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold that thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.42,0:27:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.85,0:27:40.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是那么肌肉发达 宇宙怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still all muscly and everything. How's space?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.76,0:27:41.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Space is fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.41,0:27:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.51,0:27:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你是简·福斯特吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you Jane Foster? - Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.80,0:27:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认识这个人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you know this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:48.35,0:27:49.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是我的实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's my intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.42,0:27:51.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,我实习生的实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}My intern's intern.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.66,0:27:52.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里是私人领地\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is private property.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:52.73,0:27:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们全都涉嫌非法入侵\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're trespassing, the lot of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.27,0:27:55.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,请你跟我们走一趟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.12,0:28:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.63,0:28:03.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.56,0:28:04.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.28,0:28:06.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.41,0:28:08.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.09,0:28:10.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,把手放在头上 退后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Place your hands on your heads, step back!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.57,0:28:11.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位女士不舒服\N{\fnArial\fs30}This woman is unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.89,0:28:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,她很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.65,0:28:14.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So am I.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.09,0:28:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,请求武警速到现场支援\N{\fnArial\fs30}Requesting armed response officers to the scene.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.44,0:28:19.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:19.43,0:28:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.53,0:28:30.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.05,0:28:59.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得再来一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to do that again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.42,0:29:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.07,0:29:59.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.07,0:30:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be still.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.89,0:30:09.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是地球上的物质 它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not of Earth, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.86,0:30:11.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do not know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.40,0:30:16.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,但她体内涌动的能量太大 她撑不住的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But she will not survive the amount of energy surging within her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.86,0:30:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是量子场发生器 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a quantum field generator, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.12,0:30:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是灵魂冶炼炉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a Soul Forge.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.15,0:30:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,灵魂冶炼炉能迁移分子能吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does a Soul Forge transfer molecular energy from one place to another?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.52,0:30:34.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.84,0:30:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是量子场发生器\N{\fnArial\fs30}Quantum field generator.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.47,0:30:40.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的话对你来说只是耳旁风吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My words are mere noises to you that you ignore them completely?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.34,0:30:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,她病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.60,0:30:42.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,她是凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She is mortal.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.63,0:30:45.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都会患病\N{\fnArial\fs30}Illness is their defining trait.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.36,0:30:47.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带她来是因为我们能救她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I brought her here because we can help her.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.06,0:30:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不属于阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does not belong here in Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.30,0:30:52.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,如同山羊肉上不了宴会台面一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}anymore than a goat belongs at a banquet table.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.08,0:30:53.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,他刚刚是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he just…
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.69,0:30:56.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为你是谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who do you think you are?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.26,0:30:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是奥丁 阿斯加德国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Odin. King of Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.10,0:31:00.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国的保护者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Protector of the Nine Realms.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.74,0:31:03.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh. Well, I'm…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.26,0:31:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很清楚你是谁 简·福斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know very well who you are, Jane Foster.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.27,0:31:08.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你跟你爸提过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told your dad about me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.55,0:31:10.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,她体内有一些物质 父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something is within her, father,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:10.96,0:31:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过的物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}something I have not seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.11,0:31:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,她的星球有自己的治疗师 他们叫医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her world has its healers. They are called "doctors."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.65,0:31:15.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,交给他们处理吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let them deal with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.91,0:31:17.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,守卫 送她回米德加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guards, take her back to Midgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.28,0:31:20.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wouldn't…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.62,0:31:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,碰她\N{\fnArial\fs30}…touch her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.98,0:31:25.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.35,0:31:31.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's impossible.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.82,0:31:35.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,她感染的东西在保护她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The infection, it's defending her.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.22,0:31:37.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.00,0:31:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,是在保护它自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's defending itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.75,0:31:42.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟我来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.82,0:31:46.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些东西的历史可以追溯到宇宙成形之前\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are relics that predate the universe itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.82,0:31:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,她体内的东西 似乎就是这样的古物\N{\fnArial\fs30}What lies within her appears to be one of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.66,0:31:53.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国并非永恒的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nine Realms are not eternal.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.41,0:31:56.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们有诞生的黎明 也将有坍圮的黄昏\N{\fnArial\fs30}They had a dawn as they will have a dusk.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.10,0:32:00.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,但在那黎明之前 黑暗势力\N{\fnArial\fs30}But before that dawn the dark forces,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.43,0:32:04.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗精灵 独霸宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dark Elves, reigned absolute.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.22,0:32:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,无人匹敌\N{\fnArial\fs30}and unchallenged.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.50,0:32:08.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,诞自永恒之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Born of eternal night,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.60,0:32:11.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗精灵将盗走你的光明\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dark Elves comes to steal away your light."
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.28,0:32:15.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候母后跟我们讲过他们的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}They were these stories mother told them to us as children.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.88,0:32:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们的首领 马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their leader, Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.40,0:32:19.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,用那黑暗创造了一个武器\N{\fnArial\fs30}made a weapon out of that darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:19.12,0:32:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,叫做以太粒子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was called the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.95,0:32:23.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,其他古物大都是固体\N{\fnArial\fs30}While the other relics often appeared as stones,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:23.84,0:32:26.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太粒子却是不停变化的流体\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Aether is fluid and everchanging.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.71,0:32:29.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能将物体变成暗物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changes matter into dark matter,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:29.28,0:32:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,它寻找寄主寄生\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seeks out to host bodies,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.35,0:32:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,并汲取寄主的生命力\N{\fnArial\fs30}drawing strength from their life force.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.25,0:32:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯想利用以太的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith sought to use the Aether's power.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.35,0:32:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让宇宙重归黑暗\N{\fnArial\fs30}to return the universe to one of darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,但历经了漫长的血战\N{\fnArial\fs30}But after eternities of blood shed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.68,0:32:47.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父王包尔 终于取胜\N{\fnArial\fs30}my father Bor, finally triumphed,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.65,0:32:52.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,从此开启了数千年的和平\N{\fnArial\fs30}ushering in the peace that lasted thousands of years.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.80,0:32:54.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么个取胜法\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.35,0:32:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,他消灭了黑暗精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}He killed them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.39,0:32:58.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,您确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you certain?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.48,0:33:01.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,传说以太粒子跟他们一同被摧毁\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aether was said to have been destroyed with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.62,0:33:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如今却又出现\N{\fnArial\fs30}and yet here it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.39,0:33:06.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗精灵已经灭绝\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Dark Elves are dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.61,0:33:10.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,书上提到怎么把它从我身体里取出来吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does your book happen to mention how to get it out of me?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.01,0:33:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it does not.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.39,0:34:41.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,看管这些无赖真是有失我们的身份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Acting as caretakers to these scoundrels is beneath us.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.50,0:34:42.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.75,0:34:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果他们压在了你的身下 我壮硕的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}If they were beneath you my rotund friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.80,0:34:46.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们肯定要没命了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they'd all be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.55,0:35:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要出队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.02,0:35:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,往前走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move it!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.85,0:35:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁总给我送新朋友来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin continues to bring me new friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.96,0:35:09.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,真周到啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}How thoughtful.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.08,0:35:12.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我送来的书 你不喜欢吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The books I sent, do they not interest you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.06,0:35:17.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就这么打发余生吗 读书\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that how I'm to wile away eternity, reading?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.50,0:35:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经尽力让你过得舒坦些 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've done everything in my power to make you comfortable, Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.74,0:35:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.72,0:35:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁也会操这份心吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Odin share your concern?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.00,0:35:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Thor?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.81,0:35:31.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们如此日夜挂念我 一定很操劳啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It must be so inconvenient them asking after me day and night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.41,0:35:34.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很清楚 你落得这个下场完全是咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know full well it was your actions that brought you here.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.94,0:35:36.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,咎由自取\N{\fnArial\fs30}My actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.54,0:35:38.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们一直骗我说我生来就该为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was merely giving truth to the lie.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.23,0:35:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不过是将这个谎言\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I've been fed my entire life,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.12,0:35:41.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,变成了现实\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I was born to be a king.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.82,0:35:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,为王\N{\fnArial\fs30}A king?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.68,0:35:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正的国王会承认错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}A true king admits his faults.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.87,0:35:47.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在地球大开杀戒要怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What of the lives you took on Earth?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.41,0:35:50.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟奥丁杀过的人相比简直九牛一毛\N{\fnArial\fs30}A mere handful compared to the number Odin has taken himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.06,0:35:51.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father…
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.89,0:35:53.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,他不是我父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not my father!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.70,0:35:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我也不是你母亲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then am I not your mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.97,0:36:05.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.02,0:36:14.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你总能看透一切 却看不透自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're always so perceptive about everyone but yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:29.36,0:36:32.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去找我的时候就知道我有麻烦了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you came for me, you knew I was in trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.10,0:36:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔看不到你时 你就不在地球上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Heimdall had lost sight of you, you were no longer on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.42,0:36:37.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这怎么可能啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.91,0:36:39.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我认为你既在又不在\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you were and you weren't.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.15,0:36:42.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国在宇宙树中游走\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Nine Realms travel within Yggdrasil,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.06,0:36:46.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,像地球环绕太阳那样环绕米德加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}orbiting Midgard in much the way your planet orbits the sun.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.68,0:36:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,每五千年 这些王国列成一条直线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And every five thousand years the worlds align perfectly,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.63,0:36:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称之为天体汇聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we call this the Convergence.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.13,0:36:58.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在此期间 各王国间的界线会变得模糊\N{\fnArial\fs30}During this time the boarders between worlds become blurred.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.54,0:37:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能就是找到了这样一个模糊点\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's possible you found one of these points.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.32,0:37:06.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个点没有关闭真是走运\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are lucky that it remained open.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.75,0:37:10.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦各王国偏离汇聚直线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Once the worlds pass out of alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.32,0:37:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,与彼此的连接就会中断\N{\fnArial\fs30}the connection is lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.27,0:37:29.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢你解释的方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I liked the way you explained things.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.84,0:37:33.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's gonna happen to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.45,0:37:34.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会想办法救你的 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll find a way to save you, Jane.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.96,0:37:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父亲说没办法…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your father said there was…
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.01,0:37:38.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲也并非无所不知\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father doesn't know everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.51,0:37:40.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,可别让他听见你说这话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let him hear you say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.27,0:37:44.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,简·福斯特 这位是弗丽嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Foster, please meet Frigga,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.15,0:37:46.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的王后 我母亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Queen of Asgard, my mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.08,0:38:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.63,0:39:28.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,快去地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}To the dungeons!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.14,0:39:30.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:53.99,0:39:56.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,走左边的楼梯吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might want to take the stairs to the left.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.51,0:40:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是监狱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The prisons.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.02,0:40:09.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.84,0:40:12.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧 我会照顾她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go, I will look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.44,0:40:26.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们简直像是讨厌被囚禁\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is as if they resented being imprisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.16,0:40:32.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,有些家伙就是不知足\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no pleasing some creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.46,0:40:42.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,回牢房去 事后概不追究\N{\fnArial\fs30}Return to your cells, no further harm will come to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.85,0:40:44.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:45.90,0:40:48.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 我收回\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well, you do not have my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.23,0:41:00.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,派一队人去武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}Send a squadron to the weapons vault,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.33,0:41:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价保卫那里 守住地牢\N{\fnArial\fs30}defend it at all costs. Secure the dungeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.27,0:41:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,奥丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Odin.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.40,0:41:05.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗丽嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigga.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.47,0:41:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.57,0:41:09.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是点小乱子 不用担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a skirmish, nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:10.04,0:41:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一向不会撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've never been a very good liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:12.44,0:41:14.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,带她去你房里 等安全了我会去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take her to you chambers, I'll come for you when it's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.59,0:41:16.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take care.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.05,0:41:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,历经了多少风风雨雨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite all I have survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:19.06,0:41:21.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的王后还是会担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}my queen still worries over me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.09,0:41:25.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是因为我担心 你才能逢凶化吉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's only because I worry over you that you have survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.59,0:41:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen to me now,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:28.87,0:41:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要完全照我说的做 不许多问\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to do everything I ask and no questions.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.29,0:41:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,是 夫人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:42.76,0:46:46.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德的王座被毁了 去保护国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}The throne of Asgard is destroyed! To the king!
Dialogue: 0,0:47:01.60,0:47:02.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,弗丽嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Frigga.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:11.52,0:47:13.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,退下 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down, creature.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.06,0:47:15.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尚可饶你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you may still survive this.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:15.84,0:47:18.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我命大得很呢 女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have survive worse, woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.31,0:47:20.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:21.24,0:47:22.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.45,0:47:25.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要拿回我的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would have what is mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:56.70,0:47:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你拿走了一样东西 孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have taken something, child.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.28,0:48:01.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Give it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.48,0:48:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,女巫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Witch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.23,0:48:21.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太粒子在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:21.99,0:48:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我绝不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll never tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.09,0:48:26.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believe you.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:29.32,0:48:31.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:57.63,0:52:00.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙五千年一个循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}The universe rotates on a five thousand years cycle.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:00.84,0:52:03.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,每轮循环中会有一次 各个世界排列成直线\N{\fnArial\fs30}And once a cycle, all the worlds align.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:03.77,0:52:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,把这个想象成我们的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Imagine… imagine that this is our world,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:07.41,0:52:08.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}oh, thank you,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:08.20,0:52:09.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是另一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}and this is another world,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.61,0:52:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,一般来说 他们彼此分开\N{\fnArial\fs30}normally, they're seperate.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:11.68,0:52:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但世界汇聚时\N{\fnArial\fs30}But during the Alignment,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:13.55,0:52:15.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都彼此相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything is connected,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:15.81,0:52:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国都在穿过彼此\N{\fnArial\fs30}all nine realms. All nine realms are passing through each other,
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.64,0:52:22.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力 光 甚至物质\N{\fnArial\fs30}and gravity, light, and even matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.12,0:52:24.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,都会从一个世界挤进另一个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}is crushing from one world to the other.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.94,0:52:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果这一切现在发生 后果将是毁灭性的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if this happens to us now, the result could be cataclysmic.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:31.19,0:52:33.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的重力测量仪能稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}My gravimetric-spikes can stablize.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:33.56,0:52:36.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚的界点\N{\fnArial\fs30}the focus point of the Convergance.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:36.19,0:52:38.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样 其他世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, the Alignment.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:38.56,0:52:41.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,和他们的纵列就会跟我们擦肩而过\N{\fnArial\fs30}and all the other worlds would just pass us by.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:41.69,0:52:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,太妙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:44.71,0:52:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,也很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}Simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.95,0:52:47.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,有什么问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.64,0:52:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,有 能把我的鞋还给我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, can I have my shoe back?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:46.25,0:53:47.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,简·福斯特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane Foster?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.72,0:53:50.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得跟我们来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to come with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:52.12,0:53:55.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们依然无法恢复王宫的屏障\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are still unable to restore the palace shields.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:55.31,0:53:57.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的大炮探测不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our artillery cannot detect them,
Dialogue: 0,0:53:57.04,0:53:59.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,海姆达尔都看不到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}even Heimdall cannot see them.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.02,0:54:03.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.04,0:54:05.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完全失去了防御能力\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're all but defenseless.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.46,0:54:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你把她囚禁起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's your prisoner now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.33,0:54:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,都退下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:22.68,0:54:24.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想跟你争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not wish to fight with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.39,0:54:27.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不想跟您争论\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nor I with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:27.31,0:54:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我想去追击马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I intended to pursue Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.26,0:54:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太粒子在我们手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}We possess the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.24,0:54:32.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯会送上门来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith will come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.72,0:54:34.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 他会摧毁我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, and he will destroy us.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:34.67,0:54:37.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你高估了这些怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}You overestimate the power of these creatures.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:37.09,0:54:39.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我只是珍惜我们人民的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I value our people's lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.41,0:54:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我带简去黑暗世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take Jane to the Dark World,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.02,0:54:43.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,将敌人从阿斯加德引开\N{\fnArial\fs30}and draw the enemies away from Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:43.53,0:54:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯把以太粒子从简身体里取出时\N{\fnArial\fs30}When Malekith pulls the Aether from Jane,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.59,0:54:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,它会暴露在外 不堪一击\N{\fnArial\fs30}it would be exposed and vulnerable.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:47.92,0:54:50.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我到时就把他们一同消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I would destroy it and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:51.61,0:54:52.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是冒险\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you fail,
Dialogue: 0,0:54:53.69,0:54:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,一旦失败 武器就会落入敌手\N{\fnArial\fs30}you risk this weapon falling into the hands of our enemie.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:56.62,0:54:59.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们坐以待毙只会更危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risk is far greater if we do nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.32,0:55:01.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的舰队可能此刻就在我们头上盘旋\N{\fnArial\fs30}His ships could be over our heads right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.25,0:55:02.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们根本无从知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}we would never even know.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:02.70,0:55:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,等他来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If and when he comes,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.17,0:55:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的手下会败在数万阿斯加德士兵的兵刃下\N{\fnArial\fs30}his men will fall on ten thousand Asgardian blades.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:07.76,0:55:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们又要牺牲多少人呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how many our men should fall on theirs?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:09.57,0:55:11.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,牺牲多少都在所不惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}As many as I need it.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.62,0:55:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会坚持战斗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.78,0:55:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持到最后一个阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}till the last Asgardian breath,
Dialogue: 0,0:55:28.06,0:55:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,坚持到阿斯加德人鲜血流尽\N{\fnArial\fs30}till the last drop of Asgardian blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.34,0:55:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那您跟马勒基斯又有何区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then how are you different from Malekith?
Dialogue: 0,0:55:39.52,0:55:41.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子 区别在于 我终将胜利\N{\fnArial\fs30}The different, my son, is that I will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.29,0:55:57.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,简不回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane isn't calling me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:57.90,0:55:59.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克不回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik isn't calling me Back.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:59.42,0:56:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,神盾局也不回我电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stupid S.H.I.E.L.D isn't calling me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:01.17,0:56:02.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,神盾局是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's S.H.I.E.L.D?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:02.21,0:56:03.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:03.21,0:56:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克 又是达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Erik, it's Darcy again.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.69,0:56:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor came back,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:06.84,0:56:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把简带去了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}he took Jane to Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:08.23,0:56:12.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道该怎么办才好\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm not sure what I'm suppose to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:12.21,0:56:13.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,这周还有人丢了点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something else went missing this week,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:13.96,0:56:17.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体物理学家 艾瑞克·塞尔维格博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}when astrophysicist Dr. Erik Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:17.05,0:56:19.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,因卷入纽约外星人入侵事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}notable for his involvement in the alien invasion.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:19.69,0:56:20.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,而为人所知\N{\fnArial\fs30}of New York.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:20.87,0:56:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 裸奔在… - 达西 你得看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stripped nude… - Darcy, you really need to look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.02,0:56:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的朋友艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friend Erik,
Dialogue: 0,0:56:26.48,0:56:27.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他姓什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}what was his last name again?
Dialogue: 0,0:56:29.15,0:56:32.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,并对该历史景点的游客大吼大叫\N{\fnArial\fs30}…and began shouting at visitors to the historic site.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:32.58,0:56:35.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,随后他被警方拘留\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was later taken into police custody.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.24,0:56:37.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,以待精神鉴定\N{\fnArial\fs30}for psychiatric evaluation.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.66,0:56:39.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,警方仍然不肯证实…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The police is still refusing to confirm…
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.24,0:56:52.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没去参加奥丁的军事会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were not at Odin's war council.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:52.59,0:56:55.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你父王下令关闭彩虹桥\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bifrost is closed by your father's orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.27,0:56:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何人不得进出阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one was to come, or to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.61,0:57:02.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,连我都看不见敌人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We face an enemy that is invisible even to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:02.31,0:57:03.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么\N{\fnArial\fs30}what use.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:04.37,0:57:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这个守护者还有何用\N{\fnArial\fs30}is a guardian such as that.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:07.21,0:57:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯还会回来的 这你很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith will return. You know this.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:12.96,0:57:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:14.81,0:57:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能违抗国王的命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot overrule my king's wishes.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:17.51,0:57:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便是为你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not even for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:18.62,0:57:19.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有这个意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not asking you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:20.23,0:57:22.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国需要一个坚强 服众的众神之父\N{\fnArial\fs30}The realms need their All-father strong and unchallenged,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:22.92,0:57:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,不论情况是否如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}whether he is or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:25.42,0:57:27.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但他看不清现实 海姆达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}But he's binded Heimdall,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:27.75,0:57:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,仇恨和悲伤蒙蔽了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}by hatred and by grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:29.25,0:57:30.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不都是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}As are we all.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:30.18,0:57:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看得很清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see clearly enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.43,0:57:34.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,风险太大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The risks are to great.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.07,0:57:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,从现在起 我们走的每一步都有风险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything we do from here on is a risk.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:36.68,0:57:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们别无选择\N{\fnArial\fs30}There is no other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:42.69,0:57:44.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you require of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:44.95,0:57:48.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要你们做的事 是最严重的叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm about to ask you is treason of the highest order.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:48.76,0:57:50.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便成功 我们也将被流放\N{\fnArial\fs30}Success will bring us exile,
Dialogue: 0,0:57:50.59,0:57:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,而失败则必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and failure shall mean our death.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:55.59,0:57:58.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯知道以太粒子在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith knew the Aether was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:58.24,0:57:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能感应它的能量\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can sense its power.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:00.13,0:58:02.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果不采取行动 他会再次攻来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do nothing, he'll come for it again,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.59,0:58:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这次 他们将彻底摧毁阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}but this time, lay waste to all of Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:07.80,0:58:09.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得带简离开这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}We must move Jane off world.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:10.04,0:58:11.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,彩虹桥已经关闭\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Bifrost has been shut down,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:11.31,0:58:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方也锁在地下室里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and the Tesseract locked away in the vault.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:13.89,0:58:15.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,离开阿斯加德还有其他途径\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are other path off Asgard,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:16.19,0:58:17.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,了解这些途径的人为数不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}ways known only to a few.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.96,0:58:19.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确说只有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:22.08,0:58:22.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:28.08,0:58:29.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.93,0:58:31.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,都这么久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all this time,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.43,0:58:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在来看我\N{\fnArial\fs30}now you come to visit me,
Dialogue: 0,0:58:35.19,0:58:36.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,来干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}why?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.97,0:58:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,幸灾乐祸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come to gloat?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.39,0:58:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘲笑我\N{\fnArial\fs30}To mock?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.01,0:58:42.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.07,0:58:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,别再用幻象了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more illusions.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:52.01,0:58:53.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你看到我了 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you see me brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:02.78,0:59:03.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,她走得痛苦吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did she suffer?
Dialogue: 0,0:59:04.24,0:59:06.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是来跟你一同哀悼母亲的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not come here to share our grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:07.21,0:59:10.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来给你机会得到一样更好的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Instead I offer you the chance of a far richer sacrament.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:11.56,0:59:12.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go on.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:13.02,0:59:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你跟我一样想复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you seek vengeance as much as I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.00,0:59:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,你帮我逃出阿斯加德 我就给你机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}You help me escape Asgard and I will grant it to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:19.12,0:59:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,让你复仇\N{\fnArial\fs30}Vengeance.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:20.70,0:59:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后再回这儿来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And afterwards this cell.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:29.80,0:59:33.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一定是走投无路了 才会来找我帮忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must be truely desperate to come to me for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:36.37,0:59:37.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你凭什么觉得你能信任我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What makes you think you can trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.84,0:59:38.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.06,0:59:42.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,母亲信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mother did.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.33,0:59:45.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你要知道 过去我们交手的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you should know that when we fought each other in the past,
Dialogue: 0,0:59:46.90,0:59:48.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我仍然抱有一丝希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did so with a glimpse of hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.22,0:59:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我弟弟还没完全消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}that my brother was still in there somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:51.72,0:59:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一丝希望已经幻灭 不能再保护你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That hope is no longer exist to protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.10,0:59:57.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢背叛我 我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You betray me, and I will kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.10,1:00:05.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么时候出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}When do we start?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.80,1:00:07.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,他肯定会背叛你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will betray you.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.52,1:00:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,让他试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will try.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.25,1:00:15.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太不像你了 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is so unlike you, brother.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.00,1:00:17.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样秘密行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}So clandestine.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.29,1:00:20.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真的不想靠蛮力打出一条血路出去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure you wouldn't rather just punch your way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:21.14,1:00:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你再不闭嘴我就要动手了\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you keep speaking I just might.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.31,1:00:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 听你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, as you wish,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.25,1:00:26.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even here.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.70,1:00:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好点了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this better?
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.23,1:00:30.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你本人强多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better company at least.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.11,1:00:35.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 我们还可以再低调点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Still, we could be less conspicuous.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:37.30,1:00:38.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Umm, brother,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:38.72,1:00:40.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}you look ravishing.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:41.91,1:00:44.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算变成这样 我照样能让你死得很惨\N{\fnArial\fs30}It will hurt no less when I kill you in this form.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.54,1:00:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very well.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:46.12,1:00:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许你想要你新结交的小伙伴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Perhaps you prefer one of your new companions,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.00,1:00:50.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,毕竟你似乎很喜欢他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}given that you seem to like them so much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.34,1:00:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样好多了呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh this is much better.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:54.05,1:00:55.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,服装不太合身\N{\fnArial\fs30}The costume is bit much.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:55.51,1:00:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,太紧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tight.
Dialogue: 0,1:00:56.84,1:00:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那股自信\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the confidence,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.11,1:01:00.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能感到正义在我身体里涌动\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel the righteousness surging.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.92,1:01:03.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,想跟我畅谈一下真理吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, do you wanna have a rousing discussion about truth?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:03.45,1:01:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是荣誉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honor?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.27,1:01:05.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱国主义\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patriotism?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:05.31,1:01:06.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,天佑美国…\N{\fnArial\fs30}God bless America…
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.80,1:01:09.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.60,1:01:16.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,你至少也该给我件武器啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could at least furnish me with a weapon.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:17.26,1:01:18.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的匕首什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dagger, something.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:24.64,1:01:25.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这才对嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}At last,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.02,1:01:27.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,总算讲点理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}a little common sense.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:33.84,1:01:35.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不就喜欢小戏法吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I thought you like tricks.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:36.42,1:01:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, what then?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.95,1:01:40.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心爱的凡人被一整队英灵战士看守着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your lovely mortal is been guarded by a legion of Einherjar.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.87,1:01:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们大老远就能看到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}who will see you coming from miles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:42.72,1:01:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,去接她的不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't be the one who comes for her.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.62,1:01:53.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:56.05,1:01:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正好 我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good, let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:03.97,1:02:04.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're…
Dialogue: 0,1:02:04.85,1:02:06.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是洛基 你可能听说过我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Loki, you may have heard of me.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:07.21,1:02:08.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一掌是为了纽约\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was for New York.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:09.62,1:02:10.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:11.34,1:02:12.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那众神之父呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what of the All-Father?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:13.54,1:02:17.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾立誓向他通报一切叛国罪行\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is my sworn duty to notify him of crimes against the throne.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:17.55,1:02:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要我过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You called me here.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:19.30,1:02:20.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,说是有紧急情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}on urgent matter.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:22.03,1:02:22.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.40,1:02:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人叛国犯上 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treason, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.86,1:02:25.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whose?
Dialogue: 0,1:02:26.94,1:02:27.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.09,1:02:29.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}My king,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.40,1:02:31.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个凡人被劫走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the mortal has been taken.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.18,1:02:37.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,阻止托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop Thor,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.57,1:02:39.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,不惜一切代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}by any means necessary.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.91,1:02:43.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在那儿 抓住他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}There they are! Take them.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:44.47,1:02:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,听我命令\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my command.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.57,1:02:47.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拖住他们 带她走\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold them off. Take her.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.59,1:02:49.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.64,1:02:53.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你敢背叛他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Betray him,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:53.73,1:02:54.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:56.79,1:02:58.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也很高兴见到你 希芙\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, too, Sif.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:05.01,1:03:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就算洛基肯帮你 你也救出了那个凡人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assuming you can get Loki's help and you can free this mortal,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:09.86,1:03:11.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,又有什么用啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}what good would it do?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.23,1:03:14.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们踏出宫殿一步 就必死无疑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd all be dead the minute we step one foot outside the palace.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.27,1:03:17.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我的朋友 我们不会步行离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}That, my friend, is why we won't be leaving by foot.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:21.68,1:03:23.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我尽量帮你拖延时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will give you as much time as I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:23.60,1:03:24.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你 我的朋友\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, my friend.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.51,1:03:32.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你胆敢打背叛他的主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you even think of betraying him.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.33,1:03:33.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll kill me?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.63,1:03:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,看来你得排队了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Evidently there will be a line.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.76,1:03:53.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是说你会驾驶这东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said you knew how to fly this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.10,1:03:55.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说这能有多难\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said "How hard could it be".
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.27,1:04:00.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们在飞船上\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:01.12,1:04:02.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,拦住飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get to the ship.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:06.17,1:04:08.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你在做什么 哥哥 你得快点了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, whatever you're doing brother, I suggest you do it faster.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:08.55,1:04:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up, Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.43,1:04:13.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你肯定漏掉什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You must have missed something.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.79,1:04:16.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有 我把这上面的按钮都按遍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I didn't, I'm pressing every button on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:16.17,1:04:17.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,别用力那么猛 轻轻按\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Don't hit it, just press it gently.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:17.89,1:04:20.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在轻轻按了 不好使\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am pressing it gently, it's not working.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:27.31,1:04:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,擒住他 拿下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get him! Get him!
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.67,1:04:59.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有根柱子没撞到呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you missed a column.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.74,1:05:00.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.51,1:05:08.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你为什么不让我来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, why don't you let me take over,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:08.81,1:05:10.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的驾驶技术显然更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm clearly the best pilot.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.42,1:05:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that right?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:11.32,1:05:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们两个人中 谁才是会飞的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, out of the two of us, which one can actually fly?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:24.51,1:05:26.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 她死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh dear, is she dead?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:26.38,1:05:27.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:28.11,1:05:29.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.09,1:05:37.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别多嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not a word.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:39.48,1:05:40.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们跟上来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're following us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.19,1:05:47.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们开火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're firing at us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.14,1:05:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,多谢你的解说 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thank you for the commentary Loki,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:48.84,1:05:50.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,完全不会让人分心\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's not at all distracting.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.87,1:05:57.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,干得漂亮 你把你爷爷的头砍下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well done, you just decapitated your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:08.78,1:06:10.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真是太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this is wonderful,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.28,1:06:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这主意真是了不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}this is a tremendous idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.76,1:06:16.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们去把宇宙中最大最显眼的飞船偷来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's steal the biggest, most obvious ship in the universe,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.11,1:06:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,乘着它逃跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and escape in that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.38,1:06:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,驾着它满城乱飞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flying around the city,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.41,1:06:20.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,看见什么撞什么 让大家都看见我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}smashing into everything in sight, so everyone can see us.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.99,1:06:22.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,太聪明了 托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's brilliant, Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.18,1:06:23.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,真有你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's truly brilliant.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.32,1:06:38.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,在牢里关了那么久\N{\fnArial\fs30}I see your time in the dungeons.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.86,1:06:41.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还是这么优雅啊 洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}has make you no less graceful, Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:45.93,1:06:47.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你骗我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You lied to me.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:49.07,1:06:50.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,挺厉害啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.28,1:06:51.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你满意我很高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm glad you're pleased.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.58,1:06:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,遵守你的承诺吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now do as you promised.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.07,1:06:54.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我们去你的秘密通道\N{\fnArial\fs30}And take us to your secret pathway.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.20,1:07:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,范达尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fandral.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.08,1:07:19.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:23.46,1:07:24.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了阿斯加德\N{\fnArial\fs30}For Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:29.86,1:07:31.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,别往心里去啊 伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing personal, boys.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.83,1:07:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:47.97,1:07:49.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果那么容易\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it were easy,
Dialogue: 0,1:07:49.80,1:07:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁都能做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}everyone would do it.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:51.64,1:07:52.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you mad?
Dialogue: 0,1:07:52.66,1:07:53.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.34,1:08:10.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,胜利到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ta-da.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:50.51,1:08:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,那能量要是给我 我能做多少事啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I could do with the power that flows through those veins.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.52,1:08:56.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会被吞噬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would consume you.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:57.97,1:08:59.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不就没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's holding up all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.33,1:09:01.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,暂时没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}For now.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.90,1:09:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,她拥有的力量你无法理解\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's strong in ways you'd never even know.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.72,1:09:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,道别吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Say goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.69,1:09:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not this day.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:07.71,1:09:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天 明天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This day, the next,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:09.27,1:09:10.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,一百年 算什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}a hundred years, is nothing,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.01,1:09:13.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,弹指一挥间而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}it's a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:13.97,1:09:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你永远放不开手\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll never be ready.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:16.37,1:09:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你唯一珍视的挚爱终将被岁月夺去\N{\fnArial\fs30}The only woman whose love you've prized will be snatched from you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.40,1:09:21.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样你就满足了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And will that satisfy you.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.28,1:09:22.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会满足\N{\fnArial\fs30}Satisfaction is not in my nature.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.60,1:09:24.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我永远不会放弃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surrender is not in mine.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.87,1:09:27.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然是奥丁之子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of Odin.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.01,1:09:29.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不只是奥丁的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not just of Odin.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.53,1:09:31.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你以为母亲只爱你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you alone were loved of Mother?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.06,1:09:34.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,她把技艺教给了你 但她信任的是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had her tricks but I had her trust.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.45,1:09:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,信任\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.45,1:09:38.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是她的遗言吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Was that her last expression?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.59,1:09:39.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,她信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.59,1:09:41.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你却眼睁睁看她遇害\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you let her die?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.06,1:09:42.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在地牢里出手相救了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What help were you in your cell?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:42.90,1:09:43.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把我关进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put me there?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:44.03,1:09:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁把我关进去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who put me there?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:45.47,1:09:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,你心里清楚 你心里清楚是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know damn well. You know damn well who.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.05,1:09:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不会希望我们兄弟相争\N{\fnArial\fs30}She wouldn't want us to fight.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:59.08,1:10:01.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,她都见怪不怪了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she wouldn't exactly be shocked.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.98,1:10:07.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,真希望我能相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I can trust you.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.03,1:10:24.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,相信我的怒火吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trust my rage.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:31.19,1:10:34.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞尔维格先生 请签收您父亲的物品\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll have to sign for your fathers' belongings Mr. Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:35.24,1:10:35.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:36.72,1:10:37.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,啊对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.46,1:10:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我父亲 艾瑞克·塞尔维格博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}My father Dr. Erik Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.79,1:10:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个棕色男士钱包\N{\fnArial\fs30}One man's leather wallet, brown,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.24,1:10:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,一串钥匙 共三把\N{\fnArial\fs30}one keyring, three keys,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:47.96,1:10:49.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,处方药\N{\fnArial\fs30}prescription medicine,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:50.43,1:10:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,若干\N{\fnArial\fs30}various.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.19,1:10:56.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有 - 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}- And, - Erik.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:57.78,1:11:00.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这些 - 对 这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}- These. - Yeah, those.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.80,1:11:01.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.87,1:11:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.97,1:11:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:08.01,1:11:09.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's…Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:09.97,1:11:11.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.21,1:11:14.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}So good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:14.82,1:11:16.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也挺想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss you too.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.25,1:11:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么找到我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How did you find me?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.36,1:11:18.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在电视上裸奔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were naked on TV.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.89,1:11:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 该走了 还有事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, it's time to go, lots to do.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.55,1:11:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,越来越尴尬了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Getting weird now.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.04,1:11:30.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么能让我管这些事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should not be left in charge of stuff like this,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:30.78,1:11:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,又没人给我那么多钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get paid enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.95,1:11:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是根本没人给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get paid period.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:34.08,1:11:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 我叫伊恩 达西的实习生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Ian, by the way, Darcy's inter.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.31,1:11:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,也没人给我钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I don't get paid either.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.02,1:11:41.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:41.97,1:11:43.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我脑子里有个神\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've had a god in my brain.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:44.97,1:11:46.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这滋味可不好受了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't recommend it.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.44,1:11:50.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞尔维格博士 这设备响了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Selvig, sir, your gear is beeping.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.69,1:11:51.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,果然开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's happening.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.58,1:11:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我计算得还早\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's sooner than I calculate.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:53.22,1:11:54.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait what's happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.35,1:11:59.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birds?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.89,1:12:01.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,鸟儿开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Birds are happening?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:01.48,1:12:03.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是一群欧椋鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's starling. It's called the murmuration.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:03.77,1:12:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,小时候我爸常带我去观鸟\N{\fnArial\fs30}My dad, he used to take me bird watching as a kid.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:06.24,1:12:07.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,呆子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nerd.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.28,1:12:07.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:12.48,1:12:13.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did they go?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:27.25,1:12:28.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚刚怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell was that?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.00,1:12:31.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你笑什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are you smiling?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:31.78,1:12:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现这世界比我还疯狂\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's nothing more reassuring than realize.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.78,1:12:35.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我倍感安心\N{\fnArial\fs30}that the world is crazier than you are.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.22,1:12:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,带我去简的实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me to Jane's lab.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:52.23,1:12:52.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.41,1:13:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:24.05,1:13:25.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.11,1:13:26.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:40.93,1:13:43.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这破计划得把咱俩都害死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know this plan of yours is gonna get us killed.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:43.15,1:13:44.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,或许吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, possibly.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:48.68,1:13:50.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还不相信我吗 哥哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}You still don't trust me, brother?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:51.51,1:13:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会相信你吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would you?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:01.95,1:14:03.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I wouldn't.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:07.51,1:14:08.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:10.08,1:14:10.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:20.89,1:14:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真以为我在乎弗丽嘉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You really think I cared about Frigga.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:23.63,1:14:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,在乎你们任何人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}About any of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.31,1:14:29.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只渴望\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I ever wanted.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.43,1:14:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到你和奥丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}was you and Odin.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.87,1:14:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,死在我脚下\N{\fnArial\fs30}dead at my feet.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:45.90,1:14:47.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:48.30,1:14:50.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是约顿海姆的洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Loki of Jotunheim.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:50.78,1:14:52.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,给你送来了大礼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I bring you a gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:53.98,1:14:55.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要的回报很简单\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ask only one thing in return.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:56.64,1:14:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我看着阿斯加德化为灰烬\N{\fnArial\fs30}A good seat from which to watch Asgard burned.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.03,1:15:21.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at me.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:19.19,1:16:20.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki, now!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.39,1:19:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:19:46.26,1:19:48.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们地狱见 怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you in hell, monster.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.98,1:20:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不不不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no, no…
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.05,1:20:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真傻 怎么不听我的 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You fool, you didn't listen. - I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:15.27,1:20:16.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真傻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a fool.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:16.85,1:20:18.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我真傻 - 挺住\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm a fool. - Stay with me. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:20:19.35,1:20:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.00,1:20:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起 对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:24.03,1:20:25.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.20,1:20:30.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:30.74,1:20:33.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的英勇我会禀告父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell father what you did here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:37.54,1:20:39.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't do it for him.
Dialogue: 0,1:20:49.08,1:20:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.14,1:21:46.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,他要释放以太\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going to unleash it.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.41,1:21:49.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不只是在阿斯加德或是哪个星球\N{\fnArial\fs30}No just on Asgard or on a stars.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:49.35,1:21:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯要毁灭一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith is gonna destroy everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:52.72,1:21:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}How?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:54.66,1:21:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 怎么毁灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane, how?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:56.04,1:21:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到他在地球上 他去那儿干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw him on Earth. Why would he go to Earth?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:59.89,1:22:01.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Convergence.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:01.32,1:22:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:02.53,1:22:05.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要是没发现以太 就不会走到这一步了\N{\fnArial\fs30}None of this would have happened if I hadn't found the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:05.95,1:22:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯只会更早得到以太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then Malekith would've only possess that much sooner.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:09.41,1:22:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是找你的时候发现了以太\N{\fnArial\fs30}I only found it because I was looking for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:12.59,1:22:13.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:15.41,1:22:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,结果困在这儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we're trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:23.80,1:22:25.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not me.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.09,1:22:26.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:26.86,1:22:28.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,简 是我 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Jane, it's Richard.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:28.97,1:22:30.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德 你在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard? Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:30.74,1:22:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还在办公室里 今天忙疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still at the office, it's…it's been a crazy day here today.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.00,1:22:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪 太神奇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, this is amazing.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:35.31,1:22:37.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 跟你共进午餐很开心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it? I quite enjoy our lunch.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.47,1:22:39.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,虽然什么都没点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Despite never actually ordering anything.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:39.69,1:22:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,这地方怎么有信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}How am I getting service here?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:41.39,1:22:43.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在不方便吗 要不我过会儿再打\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it a bad time? Do you want me to try later?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:43.36,1:22:45.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,不不 无论如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no… please, whatever you do,
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.42,1:22:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,千万别挂电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}do not hang up the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.76,1:22:48.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay then.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:48.76,1:22:50.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就是想问你想不想再约一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just wondering if you want to try again.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:50.98,1:22:52.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,一起共进晚餐吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, maybe dinner next time.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.59,1:22:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:54.07,1:22:55.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,别挂电话 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just… stay on the phone, okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.69,1:22:57.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,好呀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I will.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.02,1:22:58.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,天哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:02.65,1:23:03.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在忙吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Am I interrupting something?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.86,1:23:05.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,没 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no… nothing at all.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:06.12,1:23:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 走吧 - 我听不清 你在隧道里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - I'm losing you there, are you in tunnel?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:08.04,1:23:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 这是去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:09.86,1:23:10.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:10.73,1:23:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里怎么这么多鞋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why are there so many shoes in here?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:14.15,1:23:15.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,还是发短信吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll just text her.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:28.15,1:23:29.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}So who's Richard?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:29.59,1:23:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:39.43,1:23:40.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:40.94,1:23:44.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么说走就走 全世界都疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't just leave like that. The whole world is going crazy.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:44.34,1:23:46.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们之前看到的异象到处都是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the stuff we saw is spreading.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:47.40,1:23:48.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去参加派对了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you go to a party?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:48.56,1:23:49.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Erik?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:50.02,1:23:51.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:51.45,1:23:52.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How wonderful.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:55.43,1:23:56.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去阿斯加德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've been to Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:56.41,1:23:57.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的裤子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your pants?
Dialogue: 0,1:23:57.25,1:23:59.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说光着有助于思考\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, he says it helps him think.
Dialogue: 0,1:23:59.09,1:24:00.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的研究成果都给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, well, I'm gonna need everything you got on this,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:00.98,1:24:03.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有针对重力异常的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}all the work you've been doing on gravimetric anomalies,
Dialogue: 0,1:24:03.33,1:24:04.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都给我 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- everything. - Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:04.69,1:24:06.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧 艾瑞克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you well, Erik?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:07.64,1:24:09.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你弟弟不来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother's not coming, is he?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:10.11,1:24:11.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki is dead.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:11.53,1:24:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢天谢地\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, thank God.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:13.89,1:24:16.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 请节哀\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… meant, I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:16.35,1:24:17.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.41,1:24:42.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,打扰了 陛下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Forgive me, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:44.11,1:24:46.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从黑暗世界带来了消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've returned from the Dark World with news.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:49.24,1:24:50.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor?
Dialogue: 0,1:24:50.75,1:24:52.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,没见到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was no sign of Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.08,1:24:54.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不见那个武器 但是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or the weapon, but…
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.05,1:24:58.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:01.20,1:25:02.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现了具尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found a body.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:07.54,1:25:08.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:12.67,1:25:14.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯要在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith is going to fire the Aether.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:14.26,1:25:16.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国汇聚相连的地方发射以太\N{\fnArial\fs30}at the spot where all the nine worlds are connecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.79,1:25:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以增加以太的威力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amplifying the weapon's impact.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:19.43,1:25:23.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,威力随连通的王国数的增加呈指数增长\N{\fnArial\fs30}For each additional world, the power will increase exponentially.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:23.17,1:25:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,足以波及整个宇宙\N{\fnArial\fs30}The effect would be universal.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:26.12,1:25:27.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,但汇聚只会维持很短的时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, but the Alignment is only temperory,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:27.81,1:25:30.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他必须分秒不差地赶到正确地点\N{\fnArial\fs30}he must be in exactly the right place at the right time.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.71,1:25:32.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,那正确地点是哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, how do we know where that is?
Dialogue: 0,1:25:33.79,1:25:35.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,沿着路标走\N{\fnArial\fs30}We follow the directions.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.50,1:25:39.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,几千年前汇聚也曾发生过\N{\fnArial\fs30}This has happened before, thousands of years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.03,1:25:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,古人曾亲眼目睹\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the Ancients were there to see it.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.83,1:25:43.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些了不起的古建筑工程\N{\fnArial\fs30}All the great constructions,
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.05,1:25:47.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛雅人 中国人 古埃及人\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Mayans, the Chinese, the Egyptians.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:47.12,1:25:50.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,都曾利用汇聚对重力的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}They made use of the gravitational affects of the Convergence.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:50.63,1:25:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我们的地图\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they left us a map.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:52.67,1:25:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,巨石阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stonehenge.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:55.53,1:25:57.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯诺登山 大奥姆岬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snowdon. Great Orme.
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.71,1:26:00.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,以他们为坐标 就能找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are all coordinates. Taking us…
Dialogue: 0,1:26:01.55,1:26:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}here.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:04.80,1:26:05.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,格林威治\N{\fnArial\fs30}Greenwich.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:06.13,1:26:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国之间的界限将几乎消失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The walls between worlds will almost non-existing,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:08.95,1:26:10.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,物理学定律完全乱套\N{\fnArial\fs30}physics is gonna go ballistic.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:10.45,1:26:12.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力忽增忽减\N{\fnArial\fs30}Increases and decreases of gravity,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:12.29,1:26:13.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,空间挤压\N{\fnArial\fs30}spacial extrusions,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:13.74,1:26:16.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,现实的世界在那里支离破碎\N{\fnArial\fs30}the very fabric of reality is gonna be torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:19.71,1:26:21.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还是穿上裤子吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I better get my pants.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:23.52,1:26:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,集中精神 这可重要了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Focus, this is important.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:25.12,1:26:26.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得先把仪器钉在周围\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had to hammer them in all around the site,
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.75,1:26:29.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后简和艾瑞克会在塔上启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then Jane and Erik will activate them from the tower.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.06,1:26:30.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,都绑在一起了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're taped together.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:30.88,1:26:33.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这仪器是干什么的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you even know what these things do?
Dialogue: 0,1:26:34.19,1:26:35.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:35.84,1:26:37.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither do I.
Dialogue: 0,1:26:45.32,1:26:47.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快点 快点 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, come on, come on. - Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:00.24,1:27:01.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy.
Dialogue: 0,1:27:01.82,1:27:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,去\N{\fnArial\fs30}shit.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:20.62,1:28:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,何必跑这么远 阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You needn't have come so far Asgardian.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:23.18,1:28:25.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,死亡很快就要找上门了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Death would've come to you soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:25.73,1:28:27.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,那也不是死在你手上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not by your hand.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.15,1:28:30.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的宇宙就不该存在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your universe was never meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.30,1:28:35.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的王国 你的家人将被彻底消灭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world, and your family will be extinguished.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:37.61,1:28:39.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:39.01,1:28:40.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:40.10,1:28:41.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这真的能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sure this is gonna work.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:41.75,1:28:44.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这仪器是用来检测异常的 而不是引发异常\N{\fnArial\fs30}These devices were made to detect anomalies, not causing them.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.26,1:28:46.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:28:51.59,1:28:52.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点 达西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Darcy.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:03.37,1:29:05.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有那么强的力量\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, with all that power,
Dialogue: 0,1:29:06.05,1:29:07.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,出手怎么这么轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd hit harder.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.67,1:29:33.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Done.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.08,1:29:43.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚将于7分钟后达到最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Convergences will be in full effect in 7 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:43.45,1:29:46.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我们得拖住马勒基斯8分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}That just means we have to keep Malekith busy for 8.
Dialogue: 0,1:29:52.30,1:29:54.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 你最好扶稳了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, you might want to hold on to something.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:00.31,1:30:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,太厉害了 你怎么办到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is awesome. How did you do that?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:02.98,1:30:06.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,重力场与各王国之间的薄弱点相互作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, gravitational fields interact with the weak spot between worlds…
Dialogue: 0,1:30:06.75,1:30:08.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 产生了 - 干掉拿剑的那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- creating… - Get the guy with the sword.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:12.68,1:30:13.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:15.43,1:30:17.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:18.38,1:30:19.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move!
Dialogue: 0,1:30:36.94,1:30:38.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们干什么呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you all doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:38.24,1:30:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶快出去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to get out of here. Now.
Dialogue: 0,1:30:40.22,1:30:41.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你开玩笑呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're joking, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.38,1:30:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可是雷神\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Thor out there,
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.57,1:30:44.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,还拿着锤子挥来挥去\N{\fnArial\fs30}he's waving his hammer around and everything.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:03.42,1:32:04.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,请确认是否为敌方飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirming ship is hostile.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:05.07,1:32:06.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,确认为敌方飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}Confirmed, ship is hostile.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:06.93,1:32:08.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,可以开火\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have permission to engage.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:08.55,1:32:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 导弹锁定\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, missiles locked.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:11.38,1:32:12.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹已发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missiles away.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:14.69,1:32:17.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,导弹偏离目标 重复 偏离目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missiles off target. I repeat, target missed.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:17.74,1:32:19.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去控制了 求救 求救\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm losing control. Mayday. Mayday.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:19.72,1:32:21.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我失去控制了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lost positive control.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:23.61,1:32:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,1:32:24.68,1:32:26.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号连不上了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The signal's not connecting.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:28.95,1:32:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:32:30.13,1:32:31.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:13.07,1:33:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:14.68,1:33:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You save my life.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:19.40,1:33:21.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. I guess I did.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:30.86,1:33:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 达西 - 简\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Darcy? - Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:33.34,1:33:34.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,伊恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ian.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:34.58,1:33:35.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,塞尔维格\N{\fnArial\fs30}Selvig.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:36.03,1:33:37.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞锤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mew mew!
Dialogue: 0,1:33:40.74,1:33:42.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意站台间隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:44.85,1:33:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么去格林威治\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do I get to Greenwich?
Dialogue: 0,1:33:47.01,1:33:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 坐三站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this train, three stops.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:50.87,1:33:52.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,注意站台间隙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind the gap.
Dialogue: 0,1:33:55.52,1:33:57.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:35.02,1:34:36.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're out of time.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:36.33,1:34:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:34:37.81,1:34:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.94,1:35:05.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:07.32,1:35:08.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,太晚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're too late.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:09.71,1:35:11.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,天体汇聚已达最佳状态\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Convergence is at its peak.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:12.70,1:35:14.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这东西能阻止他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can those things stop him?
Dialogue: 0,1:35:14.42,1:35:15.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,在这儿不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from here.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:15.20,1:35:16.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们没法接近他\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't get close enough.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.06,1:35:20.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.63,1:35:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,马勒基斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Malekith.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:54.06,1:35:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,黑暗回来了 阿斯加德人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Darkness returns, Asgardian.
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.37,1:36:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是来看宇宙湮灭的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have you come to witness the end of the universe?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:00.69,1:36:02.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是来受降的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've come to accept your surrender.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:22.39,1:36:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得你能阻止吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you can stop this?
Dialogue: 0,1:36:25.17,1:36:27.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,以太是不可摧毁的\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Aether cannot be destroyed.
Dialogue: 0,1:36:28.04,1:36:29.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you can.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:15.60,1:37:16.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,托尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thor!
Dialogue: 0,1:37:17.10,1:37:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:28.07,1:37:29.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,简\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jane.
Dialogue: 0,1:37:59.37,1:38:00.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody okay?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:45.53,1:38:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna come back.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:49.73,1:38:51.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Except, you know…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:51.78,1:38:54.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次他一走就是两年\N{\fnArial\fs30}last time he was gone for like two years.
Dialogue: 0,1:38:54.52,1:38:56.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,他才走了两天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's only been two days, so…
Dialogue: 0,1:38:57.56,1:38:59.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他走之前说什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did he say anything before he left?
Dialogue: 0,1:38:59.79,1:39:02.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,说了 他得跟他父王做些解释\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he had to figure some stuff out with his father,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:02.25,1:39:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们逃出来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}he kinda committed treason.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:04.74,1:39:06.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他犯了叛国罪\N{\fnArial\fs30}on our way out.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:14.88,1:39:19.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾说 不会有比我更贤明的君主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You once said, there would never be a wiser king than me.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:19.72,1:39:20.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were wrong.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:21.26,1:39:24.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,九大王国汇聚在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Alignment has broght all the realms together,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:25.32,1:39:28.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都看到你用生命拯救了他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}every one of them saw you offer your life to save them.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:28.99,1:39:33.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德要如何回报它新的国王呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What can Asgard offer its new king in return?
Dialogue: 0,1:39:34.62,1:39:35.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}My life.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:37.71,1:39:40.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,父王 我不能做国王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Father I cannot be king of Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:40.52,1:39:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会用一生竭力保卫九大王国\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will protect Asgard and all the realms with my last and every breath,
Dialogue: 0,1:39:45.24,1:39:47.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,但坐在王位上可办不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I cannot do so from that chair.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:47.80,1:39:49.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基虽有不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki, for all his grave imbalance.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:49.53,1:39:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,却懂得一些我永远学不会的道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}understood rule as I know I never will.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:52.82,1:39:55.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,王位所带来的残忍和牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}The brutality, the sacrifice.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:55.54,1:39:56.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,会改变一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It changes you.
Dialogue: 0,1:39:57.48,1:40:00.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我宁可做好人 也不愿做明主\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd rather be a good man, than a great king.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:01.28,1:40:05.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我儿子的意愿 还是他爱的女人的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this my son I hear, or the woman he loves.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:06.01,1:40:08.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没觉得是母亲在左右您的决定\N{\fnArial\fs30}When you speak, do I never hear mother's voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:10.65,1:40:13.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是为了简 父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not for Jane, father.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:13.29,1:40:15.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,她不知道我要说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}She does not know what I came here to say.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:16.06,1:40:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,禁止我见她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, forbid me to see her,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:17.48,1:40:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,或是同意她与我共同治国 都无济于事\N{\fnArial\fs30}or say she can rule by my side, it changes nothing.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:21.18,1:40:23.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个儿子太过渴求王位\N{\fnArial\fs30}One son who wanted the throne too much,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:25.37,1:40:27.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,另一个却弃之而去\N{\fnArial\fs30}another who will not take it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:28.03,1:40:30.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是我留给后世的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this my legacy?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:30.00,1:40:31.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,洛基光荣牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Loki died with honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:32.45,1:40:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也要尽力而为 这还不够吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall try to live the same, is that not legacy enough?
Dialogue: 0,1:40:46.40,1:40:48.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要你配得上它\N{\fnArial\fs30}It belongs to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:49.46,1:40:51.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,它就是你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}if you're worthy of it.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:51.51,1:40:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会尽力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I shall try to.
Dialogue: 0,1:40:55.37,1:40:57.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能祝福你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I cannot give you my blessing,
Dialogue: 0,1:40:58.15,1:41:00.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不能祝你好运\N{\fnArial\fs30}nor can I wish you good fortune.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:00.95,1:41:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:05.55,1:41:08.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使我为我儿子如今的为人而骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were proud of the man my son had become,
Dialogue: 0,1:41:09.32,1:41:11.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也不能说出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}even that, I could not say.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:14.47,1:41:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我会在心里赞许你\N{\fnArial\fs30}It would speak only from my heart.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:19.13,1:41:20.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:21.63,1:41:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的儿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:25.23,1:41:26.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 父王\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you, father.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:42.16,1:41:43.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,1:41:44.45,1:41:45.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,该谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:04.53,1:44:06.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,向二位介绍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I present to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:07.22,1:44:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,收集者坦利亚·蒂万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Taneleer Tivan, the Collector.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:16.71,1:44:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿斯加德人 真是荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Asgardians. It's an honor.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:24.82,1:44:26.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我们为何而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why we're here.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:30.59,1:44:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:33.39,1:44:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,但容我问一句\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if I may ask.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:35.71,1:44:39.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么不保管在你们那儿呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not keep it secure in your own vault?
Dialogue: 0,1:44:39.77,1:44:42.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,宇宙魔方已经在阿斯加德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The Tesseract is already on Asgard.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:43.05,1:44:46.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不该把两颗无限宝石放得太近\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not wise to keep two Infinity Stone so close together.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:46.98,1:44:49.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,很明智\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's very wise.
Dialogue: 0,1:44:59.33,1:45:01.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can assure you.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:01.96,1:45:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我手里\N{\fnArial\fs30}it will be absolutely safe here.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:09.39,1:45:11.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,一定万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}in my collection.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:13.17,1:45:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,务必保管好\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that it is.
Dialogue: 0,1:45:33.99,1:45:35.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,一个拿到\N{\fnArial\fs30}One down,
Dialogue: 0,1:45:38.00,1:45:39.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,还剩五个\N{\fnArial\fs30}five to go.
